# Accepted trivy findings (reviewed).

# Unrestricted egress: the NAT instance must forward to any internet address, and the Lambda calls
# the ENTSO-E API (no fixed IP range published) on 443 only.
AWS-0104

# S3 SSE-S3 (AES256) instead of a customer managed KMS key: enough for public energy data and the
# state bucket, avoids KMS key cost. Revisit if data becomes sensitive.
AWS-0132

# False positive: fck-nat encrypts the root volume in its launch template (encryption = true by default),
# trivy only checks the aws_instance resource.
AWS-0131
